=== npc ===

<b>Calypso:</b> Thanks a lot for helping out again!
<b>Calypso:</b> This island wouldn't be this comfortable and fun to be in if it wasn't for you!

<b>Luna:</b> Say, Calypso... do you ever get sick of this island?

<b>Calypso:</b> Hmm?
<b>Calypso:</b> Well, that's a funny question. Why'd you ask?

<b>Luna:</b> No particular reason... but doesn't it ever feel <i>suffocating</i> to be trapped on an island like this?

<b>Calypso:</b> Hmm... Since I've been here for a few millennia, I guess this island has just become home.
<b>Calypso:</b> Though, the thought of seeing new places and exploring the world does sound quite fun...
<b>Calypso:</b> But with you here now, it's like the outside world has come to me.
<b>Calypso:</b> With all the stories you tell me, it already feels like I'm exploring the world - <i>your</i> world!

<b>Luna:</b> Well, thanks... but there really isn't that much to explore in my world.

<b>Calypso:</b> But I'm always more than happy when you do share your world with me!

<b>Luna:</b> Well... my parents recently sent me a camera...

<b>Calypso:</b> <b>?!</b>
<b>Calypso:</b> <b>THEY SENT A CHIMERA AFTER YOU!?</b>

<b>Luna:</b> No, no! It's a machine... um... it captures memories.

<b>Calypso:</b> I see... a blessing from the Mother of Muses.
<b>Calypso:</b> We shouldn't disrespect her. Go capture some memories, Luna.

-> END